{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55207","headline":"三句後意颂 · 智闲","name":"三句後意颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"书出语多虚，虚中带有无。\n却向书前会，放却意中珠。\n（以上均见《祖堂集》卷十九。\n注「一作」者，爲《景德传灯录》卷二九之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智闲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}